    "text": "The statement&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is NOT equivalent to:"
